WEBVTT

00:03:29.829 --> 00:03:33.611
when we stepped through
those doors and into the building,

00:03:33.635 --> 00:03:35.825
it was eerily silent.

00:03:37.306 --> 00:03:38.759
So it was very clear

00:03:38.783 --> 00:03:41.903
these were stressed,
sick, traumatized birds.

00:03:42.808 --> 00:03:45.147
The other thing that was so striking

00:03:45.171 --> 00:03:48.099
was the sheer number of volunteers.

00:03:48.123 --> 00:03:51.393
Up to 1,000 people a day
came to the rescue center.

00:03:51.837 --> 00:03:53.976
Eventually, over the course
of this rescue,

00:03:54.000 --> 00:03:57.429
more than 12-and-a-half
thousand volunteers

00:03:57.453 --> 00:03:59.772
came from all over the world to Cape Town,

00:03:59.796 --> 00:04:01.375
to help save these birds.